'''Flowerwood''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Flowerwood Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or the [[Flowerwood Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Easter Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It resembles a spartan blade, similar to the [[Classic Knife]]. The handle, which is made of wood, is a dark blue and it is surrounded by blue veins with some blue flowers coming out of it. The handle's pommel is purple-ish and has a small flower coming out of it. On the other hand, the lower part of the blade has some veins into it, while the upper part does not. The outer blade assumes a light blue coloring, while the inner part keeps the same coloring as the handle.

== Trivia ==
* It has a partner gun under the name [[Flowerwood Gun]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Flowerwood_Set Flowerwood Set].
* This and its partner gun are two of the eight gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Iceflake]] and [[Icebeam]].

